`resolveStructuredFolds` accepts `RecordSeqIndex? seqs` but the function body never references it (the note's seq lookup happens later in `renderStructuredMessages` via `_droppedFoldNote`). Drop the parameter, or wire it in if a follow-up needs seq-aware resolution — as written it implies a behavior the resolver does not have and will confuse the next reader (and `dart analyze` cannot flag it, since named parameters are public API).
